---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';

const steps = [
  { title: 'Check the eligible races', copy: 'The operator’s current race and market eligibility should be verified from its own terms, then dated in the WordPress record.' },
  { title: 'Check the price you take', copy: 'The editor can explain the feature in plain English, while exact qualifying conditions remain in the approved feature/offer record.' },
  { title: 'Check the settlement rule', copy: 'Readers need a clear explanation of how the price is compared at settlement and where exclusions apply.' },
];
---
<BaseLayout title="Bet365 best odds guaranteed — explainer pilot" sidebar={true}>
  <article class="offer-explainer">
    <nav class="oe-breadcrumb" aria-label="Breadcrumb"><a href="/pilot/home/">EveryTip</a><span aria-hidden="true">›</span><a href="/pilot/best-paypal-betting-sites/">Betting guides</a><span aria-hidden="true">›</span><span>Bookmaker feature</span></nav>
    <header class="oe-hero"><p class="kicker">Bookmaker feature · explainer pilot</p><h1>Bet365 best odds guaranteed, explained</h1><p>A focused page for one bookmaker feature: what it means, what a reader should verify, and a single centrally managed source for any related offer and exact terms.</p><div class="oe-meta"><span>Editorial explanation from WordPress</span><span>Conditions require a dated check</span></div></header>
    <div class="oe-notice"><strong>Design preview, not current terms</strong><p>No eligibility, price or active promotion is asserted here. The live page’s claims should be audited against Bet365’s current conditions before migration.</p></div>
    <nav class="oe-jump" aria-label="On this page"><a href="#meaning">How it works</a><a href="#conditions">What to check</a><a href="#related">Related offer</a><a href="#faq">Questions</a></nav>
    <section id="meaning"><p class="kicker">In plain English</p><h2>What is best odds guaranteed?</h2><p>Eric can edit this explanation as ordinary WordPress content. It should define the concept, provide a carefully checked example and link to the official operator rule. The layout gives long-form SEO text a consistent hierarchy without relying on Beaver or Thrive modules.</p><div class="oe-example"><strong>Example module</strong><p>A worked example belongs here only after the eligible race type and settlement mechanism have been checked. The component supports a simple two-column comparison on desktop and a stacked explanation on mobile.</p></div></section>
    <section id="conditions"><p class="kicker">The important checks</p><h2>Eligibility and conditions</h2><div class="oe-steps">{steps.map((step, index) => <article><span>{index + 1}</span><h3>{step.title}</h3><p>{step.copy}</p></article>)}</div></section>
    <aside id="related" class="oe-offer"><div><p class="kicker">Related bookmaker record</p><h2>Bet365 details and any linked offer</h2><p>A bookmaker feature is not automatically a welcome promotion. The optional offer block appears only if a current, approved ACF offer is explicitly linked. Its compact and full terms come from that record, never duplicated in this page.</p><a href="/pilot/bet365-review/">Read the Bet365 review →</a></div><div class="oe-offer-placeholder"><strong>Offer slot</strong><span>Hidden until approved offer exists</span></div></aside>
    <section id="faq"><p class="kicker">Questions</p><h2>Common questions</h2><details><summary>Does this apply to every race?</summary><p>Eligibility depends on the operator’s current conditions. The published page should state only checked facts and include the last-verified date.</p></details><details><summary>Is best odds guaranteed the same as a free bet?</summary><p>No. This page explains a betting feature. A separate linked ACF offer record is required for any promotional claim or CTA.</p></details></section>
    <footer class="oe-footer">WordPress owns editorial wording and SEO metadata; ACF owns checked bookmaker/offer facts and terms; Astro owns layout. 18+ · Gamble responsibly.</footer>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
<style>
  .offer-explainer{color:#263b4d}.oe-breadcrumb{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;color:#6a7a89;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:20px}.oe-hero{padding:24px;background:linear-gradient(110deg,#edf5f9,#fff);border-top:5px solid var(--et-orange)}.oe-hero h1{margin:3px 0 11px}.oe-hero>p:not(.kicker){max-width:760px;font-size:17px}.oe-meta{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:7px}.oe-meta span{padding:6px 10px;background:#fff;color:#496c85;font-size:11px;font-weight:800}.oe-notice{margin:15px 0;padding:14px;background:#fff3e7;border-left:4px solid var(--et-orange);font-size:12px}.oe-notice p{margin:4px 0 0}.oe-jump{display:flex;gap:10px;flex-wrap:wrap;padding:8px 0 16px;border-bottom:1px solid #dce5ec}.oe-jump a{padding:7px 10px;background:#e9f3f9;text-decoration:none;font-size:12px;font-weight:800}.offer-explainer section,.oe-offer{margin-top:34px;scroll-margin-top:20px}.offer-explainer section h2,.oe-offer h2{margin:3px 0 11px}.offer-explainer section>p:not(.kicker){max-width:750px}.oe-example{margin:18px 0;padding:18px;background:#f0f6fa;border-left:4px solid var(--et-blue)}.oe-example p{margin:5px 0 0;font-size:13px}.oe-steps{display:grid;gap:10px}.oe-steps article{display:grid;grid-template-columns:34px 1fr;gap:2px 12px;padding:15px;border:1px solid #dce6ed}.oe-steps article span{grid-row:1 / 3;display:grid;place-items:center;width:30px;height:30px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--et-blue);color:#fff;font-weight:800}.oe-steps h3{margin:0;font-size:17px}.oe-steps p{margin:0;font-size:13px;color:#566d7e}.oe-offer{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 170px;gap:16px;padding:20px;background:#eaf3f9;border-left:4px solid var(--et-orange)}.oe-offer p:not(.kicker){font-size:13px}.oe-offer a{font-size:13px;font-weight:800}.oe-offer-placeholder{display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:center;gap:5px;padding:15px;background:#fff;text-align:center}.oe-offer-placeholder span{font-size:11px;color:#667888}.offer-explainer details{padding:12px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #dce5ec}.offer-explainer summary{cursor:pointer;color:#1b5e93;font-weight:800}.offer-explainer details p{font-size:13px}.oe-footer{border-top:1px solid #dce5ec;margin-top:38px;padding-top:13px;color:#607485;font-size:11px}@media(max-width:650px){.oe-hero{padding:19px 15px}.oe-hero>p:not(.kicker){font-size:15px}.oe-offer{grid-template-columns:1fr}.oe-steps article{padding:12px}}
</style>
